{#
    Prints « 1 » when the server refused anything in a line of the actions step, nothing
    otherwise. Walks the line's form view, as _error_summary.html.twig does.

    Not `vars.valid`: a line the collection renumbered after a removal gets its errors on a
    form that was never submitted, and reads as valid while its fields carry errors.
#}
{% macro refused(form) -%}
    {%- if form.vars.errors|length > 0 -%}
        1
    {%- else -%}
        {%- for child in form.children -%}{{ _self.refused(child) }}{%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro %}
